Layer 7 Security identifies the applications and categories behind your
traffic with nDPI, records flows to a local SQLite database, shows them on a
dashboard, and enforces policies per interface/VLAN, user and schedule through
pf tables and Unbound DNS filtering.

This is an independent open-source project and is not affiliated with any
commercial Layer 7 product.

